    "Original pure BigInt WA helper execution only; no native crypto/WACryptoDependencies/cr8712/Signal/provider/account/network acceptance.",
    "Helper isCanonical has no32byteinputguard. isIdentity compares projective coordinates without proving point membership/nondegeneracy. No length-rejection, degenerate-coordinate or full validation contract is inferred.",
    "RFC X25519 masks input highbit and accepts reduction of noncanonical field inputs; this WA helper policy is not a whole RFC X25519 API compliance test.",
